0..79 Comment "// Reflexivity is a congruence for conversion (the HoTT book\'s § 1.12, `refl`,"
80..152 Comment "// under judgmental equality): two reflexivities are one path when their"
153..231 Comment "// points convert, by unfolding or by a presented type\'s rule, at every level,"
232..269 Comment "// and a parameter is no reflexivity."
